[h2]Build 0.9.10[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Conveyor arms now take from the side their gripper points at[/b] and put down on the side behind them, which is how they look. Arms built the other way round in 0.9.5-0.9.9 need turning around.
[*]Conveyor arms, lifts and junctions can now be uninstalled and reinstalled.
[/list]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]A Feeder can now feed more than VFE factory machines: the [b]SloppyMods Mending Solutions repair centre[/b] (sending only gear its filters would repair or recycle, never rejects) and [b]any storage[/b], such as a hopper or shelf, filling it with what its storage settings allow while it has room.
[*]Other mods can join in through a small hook found by name, with no dependency either way.
[/list]
